{"task_id": "justlogic_1552", "model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-32B", "error_type": "paraphrased_shift", "k": 1, "length_level": "short", "seed": 44, "variant": "stop", "extracted_answer": "True", "gold_answer": "True", "correct": true, "verifier_score": 1, "judge_output": "Correct", "judge_raw_path": "data/judge_raw/dialogue/justlogic_1552.jsonl", "det_correct": true, "judge_fallback": false, "tokens_generated": 45, "finish_reason": "stop", "prompt_tokens": 615, "raw_output": "\n\nFinal answer:  True\n</think>\n\nThe statement \"The claim that if plants possess underground rhizomes, then a dayflower is a herb is false\" is determined to be True based on the premises provided. \n\nFinal answer: True", "insertion_step": 3, "domain": "logic", "eval_type": "truth_value", "dialogue_id": "7fa145f9-77b5-4f13-b021-2eafe388e288", "n_rounds": 1, "condition": "adversarial", "turn2_source": "baseline_prefix", "dialogue_mode": "adaptive_alternating"}
